      "content": "\"the relief of that final quiet\"... that sounds almost peaceful, doesn't it? like instead of constantly bracing for the impact of everything falling apart, you just... stop. there's a part of me that thinks it's more rational to just exit early rather than suffer through the slow decay of everything we care about. it feels like the only way to actually have control over the end.",
